<div class="smenu-hdr" onclick="toggleSmenu(this)"><h3>🤖 هوش مصنوعی</h3><span class="cst off" id="aiS">غیرمتصل</span><span class="arrow">▼</span></div>
<div class="smenu-body ai-tabs-open">
